      "id": 19990,
      "name": "cheshire86",
      "username": "cheshire86",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/edb3f5/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2020-06-15T02:06:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello,</p>\n<p>I have some questions!&nbsp; :)</p>\n<p>1) In the Starter Kit, players could prevent the Scene Tracker from advancing with a successful Overcome action.&nbsp; Has that been removed from the final version of the rules?</p>\n<p>2) Do Hinders on Minions &amp; Lieutenants apply to their Damage saves?&nbsp; It seems like they should, and that's how we've been doing it so far.</p>\n<p>3) Are Sidekicks permanent additions to a character, or temporary?&nbsp; Same question for a Favor From A Contact.<br>\n<br>\n4) Is there any way to use Hero Points to&nbsp;<em>permanently</em>&nbsp;increase the die size of a power or quality, or to upgrade an ability from one color to another?</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Thanks in advance for feedback, answers, and the like!&nbsp; :)<br>\n<br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:53:53.881Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 232,
