      "created_at": "2020-06-15T02:22:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>1. &nbsp;Maybe I'm missing it but I don't see it mentioned in the current rules &nbsp; Overall I'd say it's not worthwhile to spend an overcome on that&nbsp;and if done it needs to make narrative sense &nbsp;</p>\n<p>2. Yes if they active penalties it would apply to their minion save</p>\n<p>3. &nbsp;Temporary. &nbsp;You can keep using hero points at the end of a session&nbsp;to keep them for the next one&nbsp;but it has to be done for each session.</p>\n<p>4. &nbsp;No &nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
